     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi All, <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I’m working with a grad student to create a Shiny Dashboard\r\nthat will give individual students a visual way to track their progress in a\r\ncourse – sort of using analytics to help learn analytics.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">We want a student to be able to run the app as an LTI link\r\nfrom the Moodle LMS, and pass the student’s ID to the app in a secure way.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I’m already telling you more than I know—before I go venture\r\ninto the mysteries of LTI, PHP and other foreign lands, does anyone have\r\nexperience or code snippets that would allow our Shiny app to generate keys and\r\nsecrets?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks for any help you can offer. And to be clear, my Shiny\r\nskills are OK, but I have no PHP background (as I understand it, Moodle is\r\nwritten in PHP) and I have the most rudimentary knowledge re: LTI.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Feeling my limits,<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Rob<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:blue\">Robert H. Carver</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:blue\">Senior Lecturer</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:blue\">Brandeis\r\nInternational Business School</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:blue\">Mailstop 032 415\r\nSouth Street</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:blue\">Waltham, MA 02454</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:blue\">p: <a href=\"tel:(781)%20775-5493\" value=\"+17817755493\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">781-775-5493</a></span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:blue\">e: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rca...@brandeis.edu</a></span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><a href=\"http://brandeis.edu/global\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://brandeis.edu/global&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389015011000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CLnHSr5L33bt7nSH-e4ir\">brandeis.edu/global</a></span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:blue\">WORLD</span></b><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:blue\">   \r\n READY</span></b><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;color:blue\">. . . . . . . . . .\r\n. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .</span><u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><a href=\"https://www.brandeis.edu/global/faculty/facultyguide/person.html?emplid=66eb1cf4f84b32fcc2559dab6b352dfd795f7adf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.brandeis.edu/global/faculty/facultyguide/person.html?emplid%3D66eb1cf4f84b32fcc2559dab6b352dfd795f7adf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389015011000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1QyBx73ix__jyq51tqM9Ou\">IBS Faculty Guide</a>   |   <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/robert-carver-397106b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.linkedin.com/in/robert-carver